@startuml CU-16
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (mis reservas)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /reservations" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» ReservationService / Reservation" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: consultar mis reservas
UI -> Ctrl : 2: GET /reservations
Ctrl -> Model : 3: get_my_reservations(db, user_id)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: list[ReservationRead]
Ctrl --> UI : 5: list[ReservationRead]
UI --> Cli : 6: reservas mostradas

Cli -> UI : 7: cancelar reserva
UI -> Ctrl : 8: PATCH /reservations/{id}/cancel
Ctrl -> Model : 9: cancel(db, reservation)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: ReservationRead (CANCELLED)
Ctrl --> UI : 11: ReservationRead
UI --> Cli : 12: reserva cancelada

@enduml